Art: included, NOT covered by this license.

Some or all of the game's art is made by Cup Nooble: the premium "Sprout Lands"
asset packs (Sprites and UI), https://cupnooble.itch.io/. The sheets the game
uses, and the tiles made from them, are in src/nexel_worlds/web/assets/ under
Cup Nooble's license, not this MIT license. Its terms are in
src/nexel_worlds/web/assets/CREDITS.md. In short: you may use them as part of
this game; you may not redistribute or resell the asset pack itself, even
modified; no NFTs or AI training; credit Cup Nooble.

The pictures that are in this repository (the enemy sheets drawn for this game,
the title pictures and other screenshots of the game, the sprout-pixel font made
by tools/build_font.py) are under the MIT license above; screenshots show the
Sprout Lands art as it appears in the game.
